            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“İzinleri atla” moduna izin ver"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence is not available on your Mac right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence ist auf deinem Mac gerade nicht verfügbar."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence şu anda Mac'inizde kullanılamıyor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence is ready.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence ist bereit."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence hazır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence is still getting ready on your Mac. Try again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence wird auf deinem Mac noch vorbereitet. Versuche es später erneut."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence Mac'inizde hâlâ hazırlanıyor. Daha sonra tekrar deneyin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approval needed": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Freigabe nötig"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Onay gerektiğinde"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approval needed · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Freigabe nötig · %@"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Onay gerekiyor · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask every time": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jedes Mal fragen"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Her seferinde sor"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At home or in the office you need nothing else: your iPhone talks to this Mac directly over the Wi-Fi.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zu Hause oder im Büro brauchst du nichts weiter: Dein iPhone spricht direkt über das WLAN mit diesem Mac."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Evde veya ofiste başka bir şeye gerek yok: iPhone'unuz bu Mac'le doğrudan Wi-Fi üzerinden konuşur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authentication": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Authentifizierung"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kimlik doğrulama"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "By default Claude Code uses the account you signed in with in Terminal. The API key is only passed to Claude Code as ANTHROPIC_API_KEY and never leaves this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Standardmäßig verwendet Claude Code das Konto, mit dem du dich im Terminal angemeldet hast. Der API-Schlüssel wird nur als ANTHROPIC_API_KEY an Claude Code übergeben und verlässt diesen Mac nie."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code varsayılan olarak Terminal'de giriş yaptığınız hesabı kullanır. API anahtarı yalnızca ANTHROPIC_API_KEY olarak Claude Code'a iletilir ve bu Mac'ten asla çıkmaz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bypass permissions": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Berechtigungen umgehen"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "İzinleri atla"
          }
        }
      }
    },
